        "slc_83d8edd14f89c3b52905bfc600a09b36b87c4baa9b9a579aa2d190c38d533d55"
      ],
      "text": "The project comprises a Rust monorepo (agents, CLI, TUI, packs), a Go gateway server for routing, storage and pack registry, and shared Protobuf definitions (coven-proto)."
    },
